# Arcs artwork is now tracked (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and docs/01 section 4.3). It is Kyle
# Ferrin's art, owned by Buried Giant Studios, included here on a fan-project footing with a
# take-down-on-request posture — not because it is licensed to this repository.
#
# Git LFS is deliberately NOT used: GitHub Pages does not resolve LFS pointers, so an LFS-tracked
# asset would deploy as a text file rather than an image.
*.part

node_modules/
dist/

# Output of `npm run fit`. Regenerable, and no fitted set has ever beaten the hand-set weights
# (docs/19 sections 3f-3i) — so committing one would look like a recommendation rather than a
# reproducible experiment.
packages/engine/src/ai/fitted-weights*.json
.DS_Store

# Wrangler's local state — the emulated Durable Object storage `wrangler dev` writes to. It
# persists between runs, which is convenient locally and meaningless to anyone else.
.wrangler/
